# Normalize text files to LF in the repository.
#
# This project is developed on Windows but runs on Linux (CI runners and the
# node:22-alpine image). A multi-line `run: |` block in a GitHub Actions
# workflow checked out with CRLF fails at runtime with "$'\r': command not
# found", so this is load-bearing, not just cosmetic.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.db binary
